==Requirements==
Player must complete [[Quest:The Secret Ingredient Is...]] in order to do [[Quest:For Rizzle]]
==To Start==
Speak with [[Wheelie Pete]] located in front of [[Wheelie Pete's Roadhouse]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].

==Goals==
Wheelie Pete has asked you to deliver a barrel of sasparilla to Rizzle in Sunstone Valley.
*Deliver the sasparilla to Rizzle
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Wheelie Pete]] located in front of [[Wheelie Pete's Roadhouse]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"Robgoblins typically only like junk, but I happen to have a robgoblin customer that loves my sasparilla.<br />Could you do me one last favor and <font color='#D9781A'>take a barrel to Rizzle</font>? I would do it myself, but all that brewing really did a number on my back." -Wheelie Pete
#Speak with [[Rizzle]] located in [[Whirly's Scrap Camp]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"Whoa! Is that a barrel of Wheelie Pete’s Sunstone Sasparilla? Well give it here!<br /><nowiki>*glug, glug*</nowiki><br />Ah, that hit the spot.?" -Rizzle
